      "faq.q1":"Does the price include a bridal trial session?","faq.a1":"A pre-wedding trial is not required and is not complimentary. If you would like to try my makeup before your wedding, you are welcome to book a regular evening makeup appointment at its usual price, scheduled according to availability.",
      "faq.q2":"How much advance notice do you need?","faq.a2":"We recommend booking at least 2 weeks ahead for regular occasions, and at least a month ahead for the Bridal Package to guarantee availability.",
      "faq.q3":"Can I cancel or reschedule my appointment?","faq.a3":"You can reschedule or cancel free of charge up to 48 hours before your appointment.",
      "faq.q5":"What payment methods do you accept?","faq.a5":"Payment can be made by cash, bank transfer, or card (POS available).",
      "faq.q7":"Does the makeup service include hairstyling too?","faq.a7":"Professional Makeup alone doesn't include hairstyling. If you'd like hairstyling as well, choose the \"Makeup + Full Hairstyling\" or \"Makeup + Blow Dry & Soft Waves\" package from the services list.",
      "faq.q8":"What exactly is included in the Bridal Package?","faq.a8":"The Bridal Package includes: professional makeup, premium lashes, full hairstyling, and a body glow session. Similar outdoor bridal packages are available with different inclusions — see the pricing section above for full details.",
      "faq.q6":"Do you require a deposit to confirm booking?","faq.a6":"Bookings are confirmed directly via WhatsApp. For the Bridal Package, a deposit may be requested to lock in your date — we'll share the details when you reach out.",
      "faq.q9":"Where exactly is Amira Khalid Studio located?","faq.a9":"The studio is in Al Rahmaniyah, Jeddah — villa 8778. All sessions take place at the studio, by appointment.",
      "faq.q10":"How can I contact you?","faq.a10":"<a href=\"https://wa.me/966530005384\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"faq-whatsapp-btn\">💬 Message on WhatsApp</a>",
      "faq.q11":"How much does bridal makeup cost in Jeddah?","faq.a11":"The bridal package at Amira Khalid Studio is SAR 2,500 and includes professional makeup, premium lashes, full hairstyling and body highlighter. Evening makeup starts at SAR 350, and makeup with full hairstyling is SAR 650.",
      "faq.q12":"Do you offer makeup at home?","faq.a12":"No. All sessions take place at the studio in Al Rahmaniyah, Jeddah, by appointment. The studio is fully equipped and offers the privacy and lighting needed for the best result.",
      "faq.q13":"How long does a makeup session take?","faq.a13":"Evening makeup takes 35–45 minutes depending on skin type, and a bridal session takes 60–75 minutes. Please arrive exactly on time so the session does not have to be shortened.",
      "faq.q14":"How should I prepare before my appointment?","faq.a14":"Come with a clean, makeup-free face, and ideally have facial hair removed in advance. Moisturize in the days before, and avoid strong exfoliation or any new treatment within two weeks of the occasion. For hairstyling, hair should be clean and completely dry — washed the day before, not the same day.",
      "contact.mapEyebrow":"Our Location","contact.mapTitle":"Find Us on the Map",
