      "testi.q1":"“Honestly, Amira is just the best artist in all of Jeddah. Anyone who goes to her gets amazing, clean, long-lasting makeup and a wonderful feeling — I guarantee it!”","testi.n1":"Reham","testi.r1":"Google Review",
      "testi.q2":"“If I had to give her more than five stars, I would. Her service and workmanship were amazing — she asks about everything you like and don't like, and does it exactly how you want.”","testi.n2":"Sumayyah","testi.r2":"Google Review",
      "testi.q3":"“Very dedicated to her work, easy to work with, quick, and extremely knowledgeable about eye makeup. She asks what suits you and teaches you the best way to draw your eyes.”","testi.n3":"Elham","testi.r3":"Google Review",
